|                        BITRISE SECRET SECURITY BOUNDARY                       |
|                                                                               |
|  ENCRYPTED VAULT (Bitrise Secrets Tab)                                        |
|  - $SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL                  - $GOOGLE_PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_URL     |
|  - $DANGER_GITHUB_API_TOKEN            - $APP_STORE_CONNECT_API_KEY_URL       |
