## 4. Step 2: Configure the Test Runner (`.sauce/config.yml`)

Sauce Labs uses the declarative <code>saucectl</code> CLI to orchestrate test execution across real device pools.

Create a folder named <code>.sauce/</code> in your repository root, and place a <code>config.yml</code> file inside it:

